  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 1700,
      "text": "You are not asking them for any reward. It is only a reminder to the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 104,
      "juz": 13,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 248,
      "ruku": 203,
      "hizbQuarter": 99,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1701,
      "text": "How many signs there are in the heavens and earth which they pass by without paying them any heed!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 105,
      "juz": 13,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 248,
      "ruku": 204,
      "hizbQuarter": 99,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1702,
      "text": "And most of them do not believe in Allah except that they associate partners with Him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 106,
      "juz": 13,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 248,
      "ruku": 204,
      "hizbQuarter": 99,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1703,
      "text": "Do they feel secure that an overwhelming punishment from Allah will not overtake them, or that the Hour will not come upon them by surprise when they least expect it?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 107,
      "juz": 13,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 248,
      "ruku": 204,
      "hizbQuarter": 99,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1704,
      "text": "Say [O Prophet], “This is my way. I call to Allah with clear evidence – I and those who follow me. Glory be to Allah, and I am not one of those who associate partners with Him.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 108,
      "juz": 13,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 248,
      "ruku": 204,
      "hizbQuarter": 99,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1705,
      "text": "We did not send before you[41] except men whom We gave a revelation, from the people of each society. Have they not traveled through the land to see how was the end of those who came before them? But the home of the Hereafter is far better for those who fear Allah. Do you not then understand?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 109,
      "juz": 13,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 248,
      "ruku": 204,
      "hizbQuarter": 99,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1706,
      "text": "Until when the messengers lost all hope and realized that they were dismissed as liars, Our help came to them, so We saved whom We willed, and Our punishment cannot be averted from the wicked people.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 110,
      "juz": 13,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 248,
      "ruku": 204,
      "hizbQuarter": 99,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1707,
      "text": "In their stories there is truly a lesson for people of understanding. This [Qur’an] is not a fabricated tale, rather a confirmation of what came before it, a detailed explanation of everything, a guidance and mercy for people who believe.",
      "surah": {
